    "description": {
      "value": "Cracks and healed fractures spiderweb the shaft of this bone wand, worsening each time the wand is used. The bone's worn epiphysis forms the wand's pommel, and black leather wraps around the handle.\n\nFrequency: once per day\nYou cast ray of enfeeblement. After you cast the spell, if the target is enfeebled, it releases a 10-foot emanation that doesn't include itself. Each creature in that area must attempt a Fortitude save as if struck by the ray of enfeeblement but gets an outcome one degree of success better than it rolled."
